  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.13.1:\n- Fix nullable warnings (CS8619/CS8621) in generated readers for [DbMap] and Table<T> types\n- Fix [DbMap(typeof(X))] on the mappers class generating a reader/writer for the mappers class itself\n\nVersion 0.13.0:\n- Runtime name providers (DefaultDbNameProvider, SnakeCaseDbNameProvider)\n- Automatic type discovery from queries and Table<T> declarations\n- Improved source generation with better nested object support\n- Method rename: ExecuteAsync() → ToAsyncEnumerable()\n- Breaking: Case-sensitive column matching\n- Breaking: NamingConvention attribute removed in favor of IDbNameProvider",
